# Place the held object down: at the configured place pose when one is
# calibrated, otherwise in place (current XY at desktop_height). Either
# way: hover above the target, descend, open the gripper, lift back to
# hover. The mirror of grab — the gripper keeps holding until the bottom,
# unlike release which lets go where the arm is.
#
# Request has no fields — the tool takes no arguments ({}).
---
# Whether the flow completed (every waypoint converged or a non-fatal
# lift failure was reported in `message`).
bool success

# Human-readable status. On failure, names the failing stage
# (preflight / place/approach / place/descend / place/open / place/lift).
string message

# How long the whole call took (s).
float32 elapsed_s
